@startuml
title cnn_v11 C++ MCTS 并行对战 — 线程模型

rectangle "进程边界" {
    
    rectangle "Python 主线程" as PyMain {
        (CLI 入口)
        (进度轮询)
        (结果打印)
    }

    rectangle "C++ GameRunner" as Runner {
        rectangle "游戏线程 0" as GT0
        rectangle "游戏线程 1" as GT1
        rectangle "游戏线程 N-1" as GTN
    }

    rectangle "MctsThreadPool\n(全局单例, K 个工作线程)" as Pool {
        rectangle "Worker 0" as W0
        rectangle "Worker 1" as W1
        rectangle "Worker K-1" as WK
    }

    rectangle "NeuralNet\n(全局单例)" as NN {
        rectangle "GPU 推理线程" as GPU
    }
}

note top of PyMain
  Python 主线程：
  1. 创建 CppMctsBattleAdapter
  2. 调用 start() 启动 C++ 游戏线程
  3. 轮询 get_progress() 打印进度
  4. 等待完成，打印统计
end note

note top of GT0
  每个游戏线程：
  1. 创建独立的 MctsSearcher
  2. 运行完整对局循环
  3. 上报结果到 GameRunner
end note

note top of Pool
  K 个工作线程（默认 32）：
  - 从共享任务队列取任务
  - 执行 MCTS simulation
  - 需要 GPU 评估时提交到 NeuralNet
  - 线程池跨所有游戏共享
end note

note top of NN
  GPU 推理线程：
  - 攒批：收集来自所有游戏的评估请求
  - 一次前向传播处理多个状态
  - 结果分发回对应 worker
end note

PyMain --> Runner : start() / get_progress()
GT0 --> Pool : submit simulation tasks
GT1 --> Pool : submit simulation tasks
GTN --> Pool : submit simulation tasks
Pool --> NN : batch evaluation requests
NN --> Pool : policy + value results

@enduml
